<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="text-align: center; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2026710205/181022+qantas-header-brand-680x70.png" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear &lt; AM to Insert personalisation &gt;,</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">I hope you are keeping well and safe. Please find attached overview of some important changes to our domestic fare structure, which includes changes to your Corporate Deal and will require a variation agreement to be signed by someone in your business.</span><br><br><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><b>Introducing our revised point of sale Australia Domestic Fare Structure</b></span><br></font><br><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Qantas is updating its point of sale Australia domestic fare structure to better reflect changed market conditions as the airline delivers on its three-year recovery plan, effective from 4 November 2020.</span><br><ul><li><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">We have reduced the price points at the top of our fare structure in Y and B class.</span></font></li><li><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">We have moved an additional fare class into the Red eDeal fare family, giving customers more price options in the lower end of the fare structure, and by doing this, it has reduced trade up levels.</span></font></li></ul></font></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><b><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Changes to your Corporate Deal</font></b></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">A summary of changes is attached, including changes to your current discounts in Y and B class, for neutral or improved price impact.</span></font><br><br><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Any special conditions relating to your agreement remain unchanged.</span></font></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We understand your business travel will be reduced for an extended period due to Covid-19, however as a valued partner we would like to propose a [6/12 month] contract extension to [month /year] without the need to achieve revenue spend targets whilst the current international and domestic travel restrictions are in place, to provide your business certainty around commercial terms during this time.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">If you have any issues or questions regarding the application of your discounts to the updated fare structure, please reply by email, otherwise, to ensure there is no disruption to booking and managing travel, please review the attached PDF and sign and return the variation agreement linked within this document by &lt; insert date &gt;.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Corporate Sales<br>[Phone number]</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><i><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Airways Limited</font></i></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td width="600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 40px; height: 42px; max-width: 600px; border: 0px; width: 600px;"><table align="center" cellpadding